---
title: Dijagrami slijeda - Gamenote
---

--- Slijed 1: Prijava korisnika (Login)
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as  Korisnik
    participant PE as  ProfileScreen
    participant AK as AuthContext
    participant SA as supabaseAuth
    participant SUP as Supabase
    
    K->>PE: Upisuje email i lozinku
    K->>PE: Klik na "Prijava"
    PE->>PE: Provjera: password !== ""
    PE->>AK: signIn(email, password)
    activate AK
    AK->>SA: signIn(email, password)
    activate SA
    SA->>SA: translateError() mapiranje
    
    SA->>SUP: supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({email, password})
    activate SUP
    
    SUP-->>SA: { data: { user }, error: null }
    deactivate SUP
    
    alt Uspješna prijava
        SA-->>AK: { success: true, user }
        deactivate SA
        AK-->>PE: { success: true }
        deactivate AK
        PE->>PE: Preusmjeravanje na Home
        
        Note over AK,SUP: onAuthStateChange dogadaj
        SUP-->>AK: AuthStateChangeEvent (SIGNED_IN, session)
        AK->>AK: setSession(s), setUser(s?.user)
        AK->>AK: loggedIn = true
        
        Note over PE: Cijelo stablo se ponovno iscrtava
        PE-->>K: Korisnik vidi Home ekran
        
    else Neuspjesna prijava
        SUP-->>SA: { data: null, error: { message } }
        deactivate SUP
        SA-->>AK: { success: false, error: "Pogrešna e-mail adresa ili lozinka." }
        deactivate SA
        AK-->>PE: { success: false, error }
        deactivate AK
        PE-->>K: Alert: "Pogrešna e-mail adresa ili lozinka."
    end

--- Slijed 2: Dodavanje igre iz RAWG (Add Game)
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Korisnik
    participant AM as AddGameModal
    participant UHG as useUserGames
    participant CTXG as GroupsContext
    participant S as supabase
    participant PR as Prikaz (UI)
    
    K->>AM: Ispunjava formular
    
    Note over AM: Polja: status, platforma, ocjena,<br/>playtime, datumi, napredak, grupe, biljeske
    
    K->>AM: Klik "Dodaj igru"
    
    AM->>AM: validate()
    Note over AM: Provjera: status !== undefined<br/>platforma !== undefined<br/>progress_value <= progress_total
    
    alt Validacija ne prolazi
        AM-->>K: Alert: "Nedostaju obavezna polja"
    end
    
    AM->>AM: Konstrukcija completeGame objekta
    
    AM->>UHG: addGame(completeGame)
    activate UHG
    
    UHG->>UHG: gameToSupabaseRow(game)
    Note over UHG: Mapiram Game interface →<br/>supabase snake_case stupce
    
    UHG->>S: supabase.from('games').insert(row)
    activate S
    
    S-->>UHG: { error: null }
    deactivate S
    
    UHG->>UHG: setGames(prev => [...prev, game])
    Note over UHG: Optimistično ažuriranje lokalnog stanja
    
    UHG->>S: await fetchGames()
    activate S
    S-->>UHG: { data: [nova lista igara] }
    deactivate S
    
    UHG->>UHG: setGames(data.map(supabaseRowToGame))
    UHG-->>AM: void
    deactivate UHG
    
    Note over AM,CTXG: Dodavanje u odabrane grupe
    loop Za svaku odabranu grupu
        AM->>CTXG: addGameToGroup(game_id, groupId)
        activate CTXG
        CTXG->>CTXG: resolveGameId(game_id)
        Note over CTXG: Rješavanje game_api_id → db_id (UUID)<br/>pomocu supabase upita
        
        CTXG->>CTXG: Provjera postoji li vec
        
        CTXG->>S: supabase.from('game_groups').insert(...)
        activate S
        S-->>CTXG: { data, error: null }
        deactivate S
        
        CTXG->>CTXG: setGameGroups(prev => [...prev, nova])
        CTXG-->>AM: void
        deactivate CTXG
    end
    
    AM-->>K: Alert: "Igra dodana!\n{title}"
    
    K->>AM: Klik "OK"
    AM->>AM: router.back()
    AM-->>PR: Povratak na prethodni zaslon
    
    Note over PR: fetchGames() se ponovno pozvao pa se igra<br/>pojavljuje u Home, My Games i grupama

--- Slijed 3: Uređivanje igre (Edit Game)
sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Korisnik
    participant KAR as GameCard/Compact
    participant ME as modalEdit
    participant UHG as useUserGames
    participant CTXG as GroupsContext
    participant S as supabase

    K->>KAR: Dugo pritisne na karticu igre ( gameCard ili gameCardCompact )
    KAR->>KAR: haptics.impactAsync(.Medium) -> lagani haptic feedeback
    KAR->>KAR: ActionSheetIOS.show()
    KAR-->>K: Prikaz: [Uredi, Obriši, Odustani]

    K->>KAR: Odabire "Uredi"
    KAR->>ME: router.push('/(modals)/modalEdit', {game: JSON.stringify(game)})
    
    ME->>ME: Parsira original Game iz parametara
    ME->>ME: Inicijalizira form sa originalnim vrijednostima
    ME->>ME: getGroupsForGame(gameId) → postojece grupe
    
    K->>ME: Mijenja polja (status, platforma, ocjena, ...)
    K->>ME: Mijenja odabrane grupe (dodaje/uklanja)
    K->>ME: Klik "Spremi"
    
    ME->>ME: Provjera: progress_value <= progress_total
    
    ME->>UHG: updateGame(game_id, form)
    activate UHG
    
    UHG->>UHG: partialGameToSupabaseRow(updates)
    UHG->>S: supabase.from('games').update(row).eq('game_api_id', gameId)
    activate S
    S-->>UHG: { error: null }
    deactivate S
    
    UHG->>UHG: setGames(prev => prev.map(...))
    UHG->>S: await fetchGames()
    deactivate UHG
    
    Note over ME,CTXG: Sinkronizacija grupa
    ME->>ME: Izracun toAdd i toRemove
    
    loop Za svaki id u toRemove
        ME->>CTXG: removeGameFromGroup(gameId, groupId)
    end
    loop Za svaki id u toAdd
        ME->>CTXG: addGameToGroup(gameId, groupId)
    end
    
    ME-->>K: Alert: "Spremljeno!"
    
    K->>ME: Klik "OK"
    ME->>ME: router.back()

--- Slijed 4: Dohvat podataka nakon prijave
sequenceDiagram
    participant PE as ProfileScreen
    participant UHG as useUserGames
    participant CTXG as GroupsContext
    participant AK as AuthContext
    participant S as supabase

    Note over PE,S: Nakon prijave, cijelo stablo se ponovno iscrtava
    
    PE->>UHG: useUserGames() se inicijalizira
    PE->>CTXG: useGroups() se inicijalizira
    
    activate UHG
    UHG->>AK: loggedIn = true, session.user.id
    
    UHG->>S: supabase.from('games').select('*').eq('user_id', userId)
    activate S
    S-->>UHG: { data: [lista igara iz baze] }
    deactivate S
    
    UHG->>UHG: data.map(supabaseRowToGame)
    UHG->>UHG: setGames(mapped)
    deactivate UHG
    
    activate CTXG
    CTXG->>AK: loggedIn = true, session.user.id
    
    CTXG->>S: groupsApi.listGroups(userId)
    activate S
    S-->>CTXG: { data: [lista grupa] }
    deactivate S
    
    CTXG->>CTXG: setGroups(data)
    
    loop Za svaku grupu
        CTXG->>S: groupsApi.listGroupGames(groupId, userId)
        activate S
        S-->>CTXG: { data: [game_groups za grupu] }
        deactivate S
        CTXG->>CTXG: Dodaje u allGameGroups niz
    end
    
    CTXG->>CTXG: setGameGroups(allGameGroups)
    deactivate CTXG
    
    Note over PE: Svi podaci spremni → UI se iscrtava
